@ 46.5 - Old English-to-Scots Vowel Shifts
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Wikipedia contributors (2014), “Phonological history of Scots”.
# 			Wikipedia, the Free Encyclopedia.
# 			<https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Phonological_history_of_Scots>; and
